      "side": 1,
      "message": "This FR is probably compatible with cc_test etc as well. What\u0027s the reason for limiting it to Java?\n\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/android/build/soong/cc/test.go;l\u003d26?q\u003dandroid%2Fsoong%2Ftradefed\u0026sq\u003dpackage:%5Eandroid$\n\nIt looks like we even generate test configs for rust so they should work as well with this feature.\n\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/search?q\u003dandroid%2Fsoong%2Ftradefed\u0026sq\u003dpackage:%5Eandroid$",
