      "writtenOn": "2022-12-09T23:27:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You can\u0027t add a `tradefed.Option` to `android.CommonTestOptions` because the `tradefed` package depends on the `android` package, and in go you can\u0027t have circular package dependencies.\n\nAlso when moving it to a common struct you have to be sure that you implement it everywhere, or else it will become possible to set it on certain modules in Android.bp files but it will have no effect.\n\nI refactored the generation functions to be language-agnostic so it\u0027s easier to add this in the future, but I\u0027d like to skip it for this cl.\n\nI agree that it would be a good thing to do, but I don\u0027t think I\u0027m the person for it.",
      "parentUuid": "3ad99438_81804182",
